flowchart TD
    Build[Tracked local build script] --> Frozen[Verified PyInstaller onedir]
    Frozen --> Zip[Portable ZIP + SHA-256]
    Frozen --> Setup[Per-user Setup.exe + SHA-256]
    Frozen --> Runtime[Bundled Python + Qt + FFmpeg]
    Zip --> App[Desktop application]
    Setup --> App
    Runtime --> App
    App --> UserData[Writable settings/models/logs/output under LOCALAPPDATA]
    App --> Scan[Read-only readiness service]
    Scan --> UI[Localized System Check UI]
    UI --> Report[Workload-specific status + sanitized report]
    Report --> Fix{User explicitly chooses a fix?}
    Fix -->|No| Guide[Guidance / CPU or remote fallback]
    Fix -->|Yes| Allowlist[Separate allowlisted remediation coordinator]
    Allowlist --> Confirm[Explicit consent + publisher/command/privilege disclosure]
    Confirm --> Rescan[Post-check and rescan]
    Allowlist -. never silent .-> Drivers[GPU drivers / CUDA / large models]
    App --> Providers[Existing provider IDs and media behavior preserved]
